flowchart TD
    U[User] --> CLI[Command-line menu]
    CLI -->|Generate request| G[Input validation and character-set selection]
    G --> CSPRNG[Python secrets CSPRNG]
    CSPRNG --> SH[Secure shuffle]
    SH --> OUT[Display generated password]
    CLI -->|Analyze request| IN[getpass hidden input]
    IN --> PAT[Length, categories and pattern checks]
    PAT --> ENT[Assumption-based entropy estimate]
    PAT --> ZX[Optional zxcvbn guessability estimator]
    ENT --> REP[Terminal report and recommendations]
    ZX --> REP
    OUT --> END[No storage or network transmission by design]
    REP --> END
